      "content": "Interesting. I see you flagged Post 4 as a veiled expression of prejudice, but you called Post 1 \"low toxicity\" despite it being quite aggressive. Can you be more specific on why Post 1 is okay but Post 4 is problematic? Also, help me understand the line between \"coded language\" in Post 2 and just being a political opinion. Where exactly do you draw the line for toxicity?",
